  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven equation : **50 * 10 * 20 * 5 * 105**\n\nAccording to the question, by **replacing the * signs:**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷, ×, +, =\n\n**50 ÷ 10**__ × 20 + 5 = 105\n\n__**5 ×**____** 20**__ + 5 = 105\n\n__**100 + 5**__ = 105\n\n105 = 105 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ×, -, +, =\n\n**50 × 10**__ - 20 + 5 = 105\n\n__**500 + 5**__ - 20 = 105\n\n__**505 - 20**__ = 105\n\n485 ≠ 105 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷, ×, -, =\n\n**50 ÷ 10**__ × 20 - 5 = 105\n\n__**5 × 20**__ - 5 = 105\n\n__**100 - 5**__ = 105\n\n95 ≠ 105 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ×, ÷, +, =\n\n50 × **10 ÷ 20**__ + 5 = 105\n\n__**50 × 0.5**__ + 5 = 105\n\n__**25 + 5**__ = 105\n\n30 ≠ 105 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
